1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,388
My neighbor leaned in close to my ear. And she whispered:

2
00:00:04,888 --> 00:00:09,132
Neema... I know a witch doctor. He'll bring

3
00:00:09,132 --> 00:00:12,290
her back. Or he'll make her pay.

4
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:15,006
I'll tell you the truth. For

5
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:17,697
one second... I wanted to say yes.

6
00:00:21,247 --> 00:00:23,523
My name is Neema. I sell fish at

7
00:00:23,523 --> 00:00:26,084
Kariakoo market. I get up at four in

8
00:00:26,084 --> 00:00:29,214
the morning, every day, for my two children.

9
00:00:30,064 --> 00:00:33,796
My daughter Rehema is fourteen. She wants to be a doctor.

10
00:00:34,646 --> 00:00:37,477
Twelve of us women had a savings circle,

11
00:00:37,477 --> 00:00:41,086
a chama. Every week, twenty thousand shillings. And

12
00:00:41,086 --> 00:00:43,987
in December... it was my turn. Every cent

13
00:00:43,987 --> 00:00:46,818
of Rehema's school fees was in that pot.

14
00:00:47,668 --> 00:00:50,338
The treasurer was Auntie Rose. We sang

15
00:00:50,338 --> 00:00:52,727
in the choir together. She held my

16
00:00:52,727 --> 00:00:54,905
son on the day he was baptized.

17
00:00:55,755 --> 00:00:57,942
On my day... her phone was off.

18
00:00:57,942 --> 00:01:00,411
Her shop was locked. Rose was gone.

19
00:01:00,411 --> 00:01:03,937
With three million shillings from twelve families.

20
00:01:04,787 --> 00:01:07,920
Do you know that kind of shame? The whole market

21
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:11,248
watching you. And you were the one who trusted her.

22
00:01:12,098 --> 00:01:14,249
That's when my neighbor came with

23
00:01:14,249 --> 00:01:16,335
her word about the witch doctor.

24
00:01:17,185 --> 00:01:19,445
But that night, I opened my Bible.

25
00:01:19,445 --> 00:01:21,439
And one verse took hold of me:

26
00:01:21,939 --> 00:01:26,567
Dearly beloved, avenge not yourselves. Vengeance is mine;

27
00:01:26,567 --> 00:01:30,951
I will repay, saith the Lord. Romans twelve, nineteen.

28
00:01:32,251 --> 00:01:35,241
Rehema heard me crying. She sat down beside

29
00:01:35,241 --> 00:01:37,814
me and said: Mama, I can wait a year.

30
00:01:38,664 --> 00:01:41,049
It broke my heart. I told her: no,

31
00:01:41,049 --> 00:01:43,924
my child. This is not your load to carry.

32
00:01:44,774 --> 00:01:47,741
That Sunday, the pastor gathered the women

33
00:01:47,741 --> 00:01:49,790
of the chama. We did not pray

34
00:01:49,790 --> 00:01:52,686
against Rose. We prayed for our children.

35
00:01:53,536 --> 00:01:56,146
The headmaster let me pay the fees in

36
00:01:56,146 --> 00:01:59,321
three parts. I added an evening stall. Rehema

37
00:01:59,321 --> 00:02:02,708
did her homework at my table, between customers.

38
00:02:03,558 --> 00:02:07,677
Seven months later... a knock at the door. It was Rose.

39
00:02:08,627 --> 00:02:11,247
She was thin. Her hands were shaking.

40
00:02:11,247 --> 00:02:14,079
She handed me an envelope. It wasn't all

41
00:02:14,079 --> 00:02:16,061
of it... but it was a start.

42
00:02:16,911 --> 00:02:20,083
I haven't forgotten. But I have forgiven. And

43
00:02:20,083 --> 00:02:23,395
today, Rehema is first in her class in science.

44
00:02:24,245 --> 00:02:26,993
And you? Have you ever been betrayed by

45
00:02:26,993 --> 00:02:30,165
someone you trusted? Tell me in the comments.

46
00:02:30,165 --> 00:02:32,843
And send this to a sister on WhatsApp.

47
00:02:33,943 --> 00:02:40,537
Community Covenant is a free Bible and prayer app, with a team that prays for you and writes back.

48
00:02:41,037 --> 00:02:46,956
Open covenant dot crispus mundo dot com. And subscribe for more stories. God bless you.

